.TH GSEA 2 2000-1月 "to_enrichment_terms" "to_enrichment_terms"
.SH NAME
to_enrichment_terms \- Cast a \fBdataframe\fR object into the CLR enrichment result objects.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fIto_enrichment_terms(\fBx\fR as <generic> dataframe, 
[\fB<Environment>\fR]);\fR
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Cast a \fBdataframe\fR object into the CLR enrichment result objects.
.PP
.SH OPTIONS
.PP
\fBx\fB \fR\- 
 the dataframe object that contains the enrichment result data, the row names
 should be the term id and the required columns are \fBname\fR, \fBpvalue\fR and
 \fBgeneIDs\fR (the member gene ids joined by \fB;\fR).
. 
.PP
.PP
\fBenv\fB \fR\- the R# runtime environment.. 
.PP
.SH VALUE
.PP
an array of the [EnrichmentResult](cref:T:SMRUCC.genomics.Analysis.HTS.GSEA.EnrichmentResult) objects.
.PP
.SH SEE ALSO
GSEA
